      "name": "Route 81 Corridor Moving and Dispatch",
      "description": "Moving and logistics dispatch along Interstate 81, I-66, and I-70 from Winchester, VA and Martinsburg, WV. The corridor network links the Shenandoah Valley and Eastern Panhandle to the Virginia Inland Port and Port of Virginia chain, with warehouse and transload staging behind local, regional, and long-distance moves. Dispatch is planned by route, access, and load — not by the hour — and every move is quoted at one flat rate quoted and agreed in writing before move day. Served from Winchester, VA and Martinsburg, WV across the Shenandoah Valley and Eastern Panhandle. Guaranteed Flat Rate or Your Move is Free!",
